{
  "sourceLanguage": "ja",
  "strings": {
    "%@ の捨て牌で、献立がそろう！": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@'s discard completes your menu!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ の献立": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@'s menu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ の番": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ is playing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ を、焼く・煮る・あえるの 3 通りで。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ three ways: seared, simmered and dressed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 捨て牌 %d 枚": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@, %d discards"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%d / 4 品": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%d / 4 dishes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%d 点": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%d pts"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%d 翻": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%d han"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 回だけお試し": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One free try"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 枚引いて 1 枚捨てる。料理になりそうな牌を残そう。相手 3 人より先にそろえたら勝ち。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Draw one, discard one. Keep tiles that cook together and beat three rival chefs to dinner."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3 枚で 1 品、同じ 2 枚で主食。4 品そろえて和了り。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3 tiles make a dish, a pair makes the staple. 4 dishes + 1 pair wins."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "4 品と、同じ 2 枚の主食で和了り": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4 dishes + a pair (your staple) wins"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pro で、和了った献立が 1 週間の献立表になります。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With Pro, your wins become a weekly dinner plan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pro でできること": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What Pro adds"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pro にする（%@・買い切り）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Get Pro (%@, one-time)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pro を使っています": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pro is active"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pro を使っています。ありがとうございます！": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You have Pro. Thank you!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あと %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "needs %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あと %@ で「%@」": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One %@ away from %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あなたの番：1 枚捨てる": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your turn: discard one"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ありがとうございます！ Pro が使えます。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Thank you! Pro is unlocked."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "いまは購入できません。通信できる場所で開き直してください。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Purchases aren't available right now. Try again when you're online."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "いま家にある食材を 10 種まで選ぶと、冷蔵庫の一局ではその牌が多く出て、買い物メモから外れます。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pick up to 10 ingredients you have. In Fridge mode they show up more often and drop off your shopping list."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "お弁当": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bento"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "お弁当（から揚げ・肉巻きおにぎり…）と世界の料理（パエリア・ビビンバ・トムヤムクン…）が役に加わる。和了りやすく、献立の幅も広がる。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bento (karaage, pork-wrapped onigiri…) and world dishes (paella, bibimbap, tom yum…) join the rules. Easier wins, wider menus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この %d 種で一局": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Play with these %d"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ざる麺": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chilled noodles"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "すべて": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "そろえた役が、今夜の献立になった": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "My winning hand became tonight's dinner"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "そろえた役が、今夜の献立になる": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your winning hand is tonight's dinner"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "そろった品がここに並びます。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Completed dishes appear here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "そろった品はありませんでした。次は、料理になりそうな牌を残してみよう。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No dishes this time. Next round, keep tiles that cook together."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "そろった！ ツモで和了る": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Complete! Call Tsumo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "だれが打っても同じ配牌。1 日 1 局で、連続日数がのびる。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Same deal for everyone. One hand a day keeps your streak going."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "つぎへ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Next"
          }
        }
      }
